  "solution": "Given equation: (75 + 15) × 27 × 1 – 9 ÷ 7 × (135 + 3) – 10 ÷ (189 + 63) = 434\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) + and ÷**\n\nGiven: (75 + 15) × 27 × 1 – 9 ÷ 7 × (135 + 3) – 10 ÷ (189 + 63) = 434\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ (__**75 ÷ 15**__) × 27 × 1 – 9 + 7 × (__**135 ÷ 3**__) – 10 + (__**189 ÷ 63**__) = 434\n\n⇒ __**5**____** × 27 × 1**__ – 9 + __**7 × 45**__ – 10 + 3 = 434\n\n⇒ __**13**____**5**__ – 9 __**+ 315**__ – 10 __**+ 3**__ = 434\n\n⇒ __**4**____**53 – 9 – 10**__ = 434\n\n**⇒ 434 = 434**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) + and –\n\nGiven: (75 + 15) × 27 × 1 – 9 ÷ 7 × (135 + 3) – 10 ÷ (189 + 63) = 434\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ (__**75 - 15**__) × 27 × 1 + 9 ÷ 7 × (__**135 - 3**__) + 10 ÷ (__**189 - 63**__) = 434\n\n⇒ 60 × 27 × 1 + __**9 ÷ 7**__ × 132 + __**10 ÷ 126**__ = 434\n\n⇒ __**60 × 27 × 1**__ + __**1.28 × 132**__ + 0.08 = 434\n\n⇒ __**1**____**620 + 168.96 + 0.08**__ = 434\n\n⇒ 1789.04 ≠ 434\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) × and +\n\nGiven: (75 + 15) × 27 × 1 – 9 ÷ 7 × (135 + 3) – 10 ÷ (189 + 63) = 434\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ (__**75 × 15**__) + 27 + 1 – 9 ÷ 7 + (__**135 × 3**__) – 10 ÷ (__**189 × 63**__) = 434\n\n⇒ 1125 + 27 + 1 – 9 ÷ 7 + 405 – 10 ÷ 11907 = 434\n\n⇒ __**1125 + 27 + 1**__ – 1.28 __**+ 405**__ – 0.00084 = 434\n\n⇒ __**1558 – 1.28 – 0.00084**__ = 434\n\n⇒ 1556.7116 ≠ 434\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) ÷ and –\n\nGiven: (75 + 15) × 27 × 1 – 9 ÷ 7 × (135 + 3) – 10 ÷ (189 + 63) = 434\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ (__**75 + 15**__) × 27 × 1 ÷ 9 - 7 × (__**135 + 3**__) ÷ 10 - (__**189 + 63**__) = 434\n\n⇒ __**90**____** × 27 × 1 ÷ 9**__ - 7 × __**138 ÷ 10**__ - 252 = 434\n\n⇒ 270 - __**7 × 13.8**__ - 252 = 434\n\n⇒ __**270 - 96.6 - 252**__ = 434\n\n⇒ -78.6 ≠ 434\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
